  "details": "Since the UI overhaul my main menu opens tilted because of my real head is on a slight angle, screenshot attached how the big menu opens for me because of my head.\n\nThis causes me to look at a angled big menu everytime I open it which is not fun.\n\nIn order to get the menu horizontal I have to tilt my real head just before I open the menu.\n\nThere is no fixed menu horizon option.\n\nSo for me this is a mild accessability issue as the big menu is always on a angle for me.\n\nPlease allow a accessabilty feature to keep the menu level with the horizon.",
